      "message": "Add change_role action for Managers.\n\nManagers can promote member to admin or demote admin to member.\n\nGuards enforced such as only managers can change roles, manager self role change is prevented, cannot change other manager roles, cannot promote to manager (only admin and member.)\n\nRequire_manager in applicationcontroller is added, also excluding change_role so non-managers know they are not authorized to change roles.\n\nSpecs included.",
