        "date": "2026-09-23T04:54:13Z"
      },
      "message": "Fixed test setup for role seeding.\n\n1. Added before(:suite) to spec/rails_helper.rb that makes sure the three\nroles exist (Member, Admin, Manager). Test environments wasn't creating\nthe roles so any specs that relied on roles existing would fail, now\nthey exist in the entire test.\n\n2. In member_standing_spec.rb, the Role.create! is now\nfind_or_create_by! for admin and member. create! tries to insert new\nrows. Unique index in the roles db prevents it. It now reuses a role\ninstead of creating. \"member\" was also changed to \"Member\" to match\nexisting code.",
